nteractiva. Fue el primer sistema operativo que estaba entre el hardware y los programas. (","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"HpdNjdAXdX"},{"type":"link","url":"https://leahycenterblog.champlain.edu/2022/03/29/pioneers-in-tech-mary-allen-wilkes/","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"“Pioneers in Tech”","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"CYTH8ujaFV"}],"urlSource":"https://leahycenterblog.champlain.edu/2022/03/29/pioneers-in-tech-mary-allen-wilkes/","key":"RGydRLyE9g"},{"type":"text","value":"). Además, al integrar al sistema LINC un editor de texto que utilizaba una pantalla y teclado, cimentó las bases de interacción con los sistemas de cómputo actuales (","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"iu5R4YxC12"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.mobolize.com/2023/03/07/womens-history-month-mary-allen-wilkes-was-a-linc-programmer-and-first-to-use-a-pc-at-home/","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ver nota","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"Z9TncKdWEX"}],"urlSource":"https://www.mobolize.com/2023/03/07/womens-history-month-mary-allen-wilkes-was-a-linc-programmer-and-first-to-use-a-pc-at-home/","key":"fqJJoxb7zw"},{"type":"text","value":")","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"zmjS9spLly"}],"key":"ypX6Wt6xsX"},{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/02-allen-fd0b5ddb7672935ce0b87f596e99a879.png","alt":"Mary Allen en el año 2017 con el ordenador personal de 1960 que ella desarrolló. Fotografía: Imago/EDP/Werner Kruepe","width":"50%","align":"center","data":{"altTextIsAutoGenerated":true},"key":"MfB0CknNcB","urlSource":"images/02-allen.png","urlOptimized":"/02-allen-fd0b5ddb7672935ce0b87f596e99a879